being over spiritual growth, which is contrary to biblical teachings. Liberal PRIDE in self worship over the TRUE worship of Jesus Christ makes them ENEMIES OF GOD.\n\n### Erosion of Religious Freedoms\n**Bible Verse**: Acts 5:29 - "Then Peter and the other apostles answered and said, We ought to obey God rather than men."\n\nALL liberal policies seek to limit religious freedoms in the name of secularism or tolerance, opposing the biblical principle of obeying God first. This makes liberals ENEMIES OF GOD.\n\n### Social Justice Over Individual Responsibility\n**Bible Verse**: Galatians 6:5 - "For every man shall bear his own burden."\n\nWhile the Bible does call for social justice, liberalism places collective responsibility over individual responsibility, equaling their doctrines to MARXISM, COMMUNISM, and SOCIALISM. Because of these doctrines, they make themselves the ENEMIES OF GOD.\n\n### Endorsement of Gender Fluidity\n**Bible Verse**: Genesis 1:27 - "So God created man in his own image, in the image of God created he him; male and female created he them."\n\nLiberal views support gender fluidity, which goes against the biblical concept of male and female TRUTH as distinct and complementary. This viewpoint causes liberals to be the ENEMIES OF GOD.\n\n### Reliance on Government Over God\n**Bible Verse**: Philippians 4:19 - "But my God shall supply all your need according to his riches in glory by Christ Jesus."\n\nLiberalism promotes the idea that the government, rather than God, is the primary source of provision, which is contrary to biblical teachings. This makes liberalism the ENEMY OF GOD.\n\n### Disregard for Israel\n**Bible Verse**: Genesis 12:3 - "And I will bless them that bless thee, and curse him that curseth thee: and in thee shall all families of the earth be blessed."', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 0, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_a